# Sun Pool & Spa Supply — content tokens for hydrate.
# Cloudflare runtime secrets (GHL, Meta CAPI, admin, Sheets private key) are NOT
# stored here — they live in Pages env only. Do not paste secrets into this file.
#
# tokens.env — content tokens for this client (sourced at build time)

# www is the canonical host: it is the only hostname attachable to Pages while DNS
# stays at SiteGround (the apex cannot CNAME). The apex 301s here.
# Social share card image. Must be an ABSOLUTE url — scrapers do not resolve
# relative paths. Reusing the hero for now; a dedicated 1200x630 JPG/PNG crop
# renders better (this 16:10 webp gets centre-cropped by Facebook).
OG_IMAGE_URL="https://www.sunpoolandspasupply.com/assets/HERO_sun-pool-spa-hydropool-blue-led-hot-tub.webp"

# Offer section. This dealer runs EVERGREEN: no end date, so OFFER_ENDS_AT and
# OFFER_ENDS_LABEL are deliberately empty and the countdown panel is hidden by
# body.offer-static. The remaining OFFER_* tokens are still hard-required —
# OFFER_NAME is set in client.config.js, so the whole section ships and every
# member must hydrate or it reaches the page as a literal {{OFFER_*}}.
OFFER_WHEN_LINE="Open year-round in Lakeside"
OFFER_SECTION_HEADLINE="There has never been a better time to buy a hot tub"
OFFER_SECTION_COPY="Come see real units running on our floor, talk to the same family that has served East County for 47 years, and get out-the-door pricing with nothing hidden."
OFFER_BULLET_1="Working models on the showroom floor — see and feel the jets before you buy"
OFFER_BULLET_2="Out-the-door pricing that includes delivery and professional installation"
OFFER_BULLET_3="Flexible financing available for all credit types"
OFFER_BULLET_4="Local service after the sale from the team that installed it"
OFFER_SECONDARY_CTA="Request Pricing"
# Rendered only when a countdown is running; kept filled so an evergreen build
# still hydrates cleanly if this dealer later sets an end date.
OFFER_COUNTDOWN_LABEL="Visit the showroom"
OFFER_SIDE_COPY="Stop by Mon-Sat or call and we will walk you through what is on the floor today."

# REVIEW_n_INITIAL fills the avatar circle and REVIEW_n_META the byline under the
# name. The template does not compose them from NAME/MONTH/SOURCE, so all three
# groups have to be supplied explicitly.
REVIEWS_TOTAL_LINE="Rated 4.7 out of 5 across 48 Google reviews"

REVIEW_1_NAME=Karen
REVIEW_1_INITIAL=K
REVIEW_1_META="Google Review · July 2026"
REVIEW_1_TEXT="I’ve used this supply store for many years as I service my own pool. I’ve learned to Love this team! Joe, David and Paul are all incredibly knowledgeable and helpful."

REVIEW_2_NAME=Andy
REVIEW_2_INITIAL=A
REVIEW_2_META="Google Review · July 2026"
REVIEW_2_TEXT="Worked with owner Joe. Great guy and really helped me out with getting the right hot tub. Can't wait for delivery and set up. Glad to keep business local."

REVIEW_3_NAME=Meagan
REVIEW_3_INITIAL=M
REVIEW_3_META="Google Review · July 2026"
REVIEW_3_TEXT="I have been coming here for about 2 years and have learned so much about pool care! I am never afraid to ask questions and value their expertise!"

